# The build needs only: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md and src/.
# Allow-list rather than deny-list, so a new local file (a wallet, an .env, a 2 GB test
# fixture) can never reach the build context or an image layer by accident.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!src/

# Even inside src/: never caches or compiled files from the host.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
